! _POC-XRQOS CE2(IOL 17.15)= VRF A のお客さまの CE(拠点 2)。LAN= Loopback100 10.100.2.1/24。印を付けて送る方策は PoC の段で足す。
interface {{ links[0] }}
 description to PE
 ip address 172.16.2.1 255.255.255.0
 no shutdown
!
interface Loopback100
 description site 2 LAN
 ip address 10.100.2.1 255.255.255.0
!
router bgp 65002
 bgp router-id 10.100.2.1
 bgp log-neighbor-changes
 neighbor 172.16.2.254 remote-as 65000
 !
 address-family ipv4
  network 10.100.2.0 mask 255.255.255.0
  neighbor 172.16.2.254 activate
 exit-address-family
!
